{"id":"paz","lemma":"paz","pos":"noun","rank":384,"glosses":["peace (warlessness)","peace (a state of tranquility, quiet, and harmony)"],"ipa":"/ˈpaθ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"paces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/54/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-paz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me siento en paz.","en":"I feel at ease.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440757","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Vinieron a hacer las paces.","en":"They came to make peace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639340","words":[{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"the / them"},null]},{"text":"El presidente quiere la paz, ¿verdad?","en":"The President desires peace, doesn't he?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689283","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"truth"}]},{"text":"Es hora de que hagan las paces.","en":"It's time for you guys to make up.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/767801","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"hour"},null,null,{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"the / them"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"that"]]},{"text":"Ellos viven en paz.","en":"They live in peace.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636715","words":[{"g":"they","l":"él"},{"g":"to applaud","l":"vivar"},{"g":"in / on"},null]}]}